{"data":{"guards":[{"name":"The as-of rule","src":"https://github.com/eleonorabjornberg/repo-market-model/blob/main/docs/decisions/information-set.md","text":"Each forecast reads every input at its latest value public at the decision time the day before, field by field"},{"name":"Leakage and staleness guards","src":"https://github.com/eleonorabjornberg/repo-market-model/blob/main/src/repo_model/asof.py","text":"A read newer than the decision instant raises LookAheadError; a read older than the latest admissible value raises StaleReadError"},{"name":"The panel digest","src":"https://github.com/eleonorabjornberg/repo-market-model/blob/main/metadata/funding_panel_manifest.json","text":"The panel rebuilds from tracked files and is refused unless its SHA-256 matches the published manifest"},{"name":"A locked test period","src":"https://github.com/eleonorabjornberg/repo-market-model/blob/main/docs/decisions/lockbox.md","text":"Recent days are held back from every model comparison until a phase verdict opens them"}],"process":[{"src":"https://github.com/eleonorabjornberg/repo-market-model/blob/main/docs/decisions/workflow.md","step":"Directive","text":"Work starts from a directive: an issue with a goal, acceptance criteria and the files to read"},{"src":"https://github.com/eleonorabjornberg/repo-market-model/blob/main/docs/decisions/workflow.md","step":"Session","text":"One session works one directive on its own branch, test first"},{"src":"https://github.com/eleonorabjornberg/repo-market-model/blob/main/docs/decisions/workflow.md","step":"Pull request","text":"The pull request is the report: what changed, the evidence, what was checked and what was not"},{"src":"https://github.com/eleonorabjornberg/repo-market-model/blob/main/docs/decisions/workflow.md","step":"Review","text":"A separate Claude review routine, not Eleonora, checks each acceptance criterion against the tree and merges; judgement calls go to her"},{"src":"https://github.com/eleonorabjornberg/repo-market-model/blob/main/docs/decisions/publish-rule.md","step":"Publish","text":"A record is published only while nothing that computes a figure, declares a source or supplies the panel has changed since it was scored"}],"validation":{"src":"https://github.com/eleonorabjornberg/repo-market-model/blob/main/docs/pivot/lag-assessment.md","text":"An audit of the scoring code found that every published record had read its inputs later than they were public. That leaks nothing, but it is not what a forecaster at the decision time would have had, so every record was archived and re-scored under the as-of rule"}},"provenance":{"commit":"ad90cbb3da389bc146f8569fa822275de056bae1","generator":"scripts/emit_visual.py","inputs":{"docs/visual/annotations.json":"5c648a518273db3c05b6877174004a1f040cb4d2e856161439c5060b1086de4a","docs/visual/glossary.json":"b9b130bf96496a03f18e1d5958285736babb993b809072330fc5b9477217a1bf","docs/visual/sources/feds-quarter-ends-20250606.htm":"5f0439836495cdd82937a920b271dc79dbffc8e823d70ae3d71d906b00a44391","docs/visual/sources/feds-repo-markets-20260826.htm":"53303561bee6d2a8d1bd52ff82754525d309cceffb7acf99fa2251aecaa4f818","docs/visual/sources/feds-september-2019-20200227.htm":"bde9360d9bf21fdaa0222c6f94560a2b708575bc516bd66e1619a8f868a44f03","docs/visual/sources/monetary20210728b.htm":"5d7b4a072a81b6c04a42187b214e9c2d4b4b0169d0c702c2305724d8f80a2e22","docs/visual/sources/monetary20240501a.htm":"9e2c71bbd6adaddc73dddda9ff0a47b165627ec79919a2dbc206f36dab2f3944","docs/visual/sources/monetary20250319a.htm":"b1524ea1c9687e91efd0db566bb5c1975777e911c954bd9747992d059dbff1a3","docs/visual/sources/monetary20251029a1.htm":"7df8acedd3faa218c0cb93021f3e0dc82332e1684a92fa2335368db32915088c","docs/visual/sources/monetary20260916a1.htm":"ca952b275bbb6fccc07ef2ec02715f5e405b1185538985b40ac4fe496b55105b","docs/visual/sources/nyfed-reference-rates-additional-information.htm":"5a0a18c99a0c5329aa0786363679a432b380ab035cbbee9892b73889b095e2c9","metadata/evaluation_splits.json":"